+// PATCH(tier #10.3.1b): noteDirectCandidate records src.ap as a live direct
+// path for de — the WireGuard roaming rule ("a packet we just received provably
+// came from the address we received it from"). An unknown address is added as a
+// candidate, a known one has its lastGotPing refreshed so the network map
+// cleanup (sessionActiveTimeout) does not delete a path we are actively
+// receiving from.
+//
